  <!-- Troll bands (#694): wild trolls as bandits, about one band of two to four per kingdom, hostile only and never
       recruitable. Each is a hidden twin of a Mordor troll (troops/troops_mordor.xml): the same race, level, skills,
       face and gear, the combination already proven to render and fight, so every race-keyed troll trait applies
       (hit points, knockdown resistance, brute force). Only the identity differs: bandit occupation, the wild_trolls
       culture, hidden from the encyclopedia, and their own ids, which the prisoner rule refuses
       (CreatureBanditsConfig.TrollBanditTroopIds) while Mordor's trolls stay capturable. They appear only in
       wild_trolls_band_template; TrollBanditDataTests keeps the twins equal to their Mordor originals. -->

